  "vibe": "Bristol board #f6f4ec, ink #1a1a1e and a four-colour comic kit: action red #e8402e, cyan #3cb8e8, yellow #f2c14b. Bangers slams every headline in caps; Lexend handles the fine print. The world is a page being made — a panel border strokes itself around the frame, gutter lines snap in at 60% and 80%, thirty cyan Ben-Day dots grid the corner, five speed lines rake across at -16°, a red dashed circle spins at 80°/s, and a yellow POW! starburst punches in with a 5px ink outline. Statement beats flood full red at 156px, the largest type here. The camera hits hardest of any pack — 7× multiplier with a spin in the set, 4° of skew, titles landing from 2.2× scale. Mechanics: jittering typewriter text, split-flap SFX words, a chip flown into a paste-up slot, and a deck flicked panel by panel.",
